SlideFormer multi-GPU extension
Copyright 2025-2026 The SlideFormer Authors

This multi-GPU version extends the published single-GPU SlideFormer runtime:
https://github.com/RegiaYoung/SlideFormer
Base revision: 062322fbb1b1f078b4a25dae60640914d0521e0a

This distribution includes components derived from Microsoft DeepSpeed and
NVIDIA Apex under optimizer/layer_adam/. Original copyright and license
notices are retained in the corresponding source files.

The vendored fused linear cross-entropy implementation is derived from
LinkedIn Liger Kernel under the BSD 2-Clause License. Its license is included
in LICENSES/liger-kernel.txt.
Upstream: https://github.com/linkedin/Liger-Kernel

Text-model input preparation in utils/model_compat.py follows Hugging Face
Transformers (Apache License 2.0), including the Qwen3.5 and Gemma 4 model
implementations. Attention and expert operators remain upstream dependencies.
Upstream: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/v5.5.4/src/transformers/models

